{"id":"60f9a1c1bcd5e07c","group":"93","path":"93/93-cor-generated-variety.md","title":"Generated Variety","display":"Generated Variety","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-cor-generated-variety","aliases":["93-cor-generated-variety"],"display":"Generated Variety","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-variety]]","[[93-df-closure-operators]]","[[93-thm-generated-variety]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-cor-generated-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-cor-generated-variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Generated Variety"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d8af34fe512640e2\" href=\"?note=d8af34fe512640e2\" title=\"93-thm-generated-variety\">93-thm-generated-variety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"cor-generated-variety---Generated-Variety\">cor-generated-variety - Generated Variety</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\">\\(K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HSP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HSP}\\)</span> are the operators of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" href=\"?note=f0b0edbaa6696a1d\" title=\"93-df-variety\">93-df-variety</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"97b46a497e251f9f\" href=\"?note=97b46a497e251f9f\" title=\"93-df-closure-operators\">93-df-closure-operators</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\land K\\subseteq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\}\\to\n\\operatorname{VGen}_{93,\\tau}(K)=\\mathrm{HSP}_{\\tau}(K)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The generated variety is obtained by the usual HSP closure operation.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"cor-generated-variety---Generated-Variety","text":"cor-generated-variety - Generated Variety","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-variety","status":"resolved","id":"f0b0edbaa6696a1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-variety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-closure-operators","status":"resolved","id":"97b46a4